      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 8.41,
      "end_seconds": 13.53,
      "duration_seconds": 5.12,
      "text": "Of course, put it down anywhere. So, how can I help?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0003",
      "speaker_id": "person_3",
      "role": "FAMILY_MEMBER",
      "start_seconds": 14.72,
      "end_seconds": 22.63,
      "duration_seconds": 7.91,
      "text": "hello, uh, doctor. I hope it's alright if I stay in for this"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0004",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 23.68,
      "end_seconds": 27.57,
      "duration_seconds": 3.89,
      "text": "that's fine sit down we'll go through it together"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0005",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 33.04,
      "end_seconds": 47.68,
      "duration_seconds": 14.64,
      "text": "so, I've been wanting to stop smoking, doctor i'd rather know what's going on than keep guessing and there's cravings, mostly after meals as well, two weeks now"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0006",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 49.19,
      "end_seconds": 51.77,
      "duration_seconds": 2.58,
      "text": "is it mild moderate or severe?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0007",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 52.86,
      "end_seconds": 54.41,
      "duration_seconds": 1.55,
      "text": "Moderate I'd say"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0008",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 55.71,
      "end_seconds": 60.44,
      "duration_seconds": 4.73,
      "text": "any irritability when you try to cut down as well?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0009",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 62.09,
      "end_seconds": 64.12,
      "duration_seconds": 2.03,
      "text": "mm um yes"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0010",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 64.69,
      "end_seconds": 68.02,
      "duration_seconds": 3.33,
      "text": "Okay. Let me check your vitals now."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0011",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 78.75,
      "end_seconds": 80.97,
      "duration_seconds": 2.22,
      "text": "So rest your hand here..."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0012",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 97.9,
      "end_seconds": 109.72,
      "duration_seconds": 11.82,
      "text": "okay: height 161 centimetres, weight 82 kilos, heart rate 68, blood pressure 119 over 78, respiratory rate 17, SpO2 97 percent on room air"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0013",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 111.59,
      "end_seconds": 114.61,
      "duration_seconds": 3.02,
      "text": "oh, is that alright, doctor?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0014",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 115.26,
      "end_seconds": 118.01,
      "duration_seconds": 2.75,
      "text": "I'll come back to those numbers"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0015",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 120.62,
      "end_seconds": 124.52,
      "duration_seconds": 3.9,
      "text": "Come over here and I'll have a look."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0016",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 125.51,
      "end_seconds": 126.77,
      "duration_seconds": 1.26,
      "text": "I'll go gently"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0017",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 145.61,
      "end_seconds": 150.53,
      "duration_seconds": 4.92,
      "text": "chest sounds clear, a bit of wheeze when you breathe out hard"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0018",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 156.27,
      "end_seconds": 158.73,
      "duration_seconds": 2.46,
      "text": "That's all I need thank you."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0019",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 168.08,
      "end_seconds": 171.75,
      "duration_seconds": 3.67,
      "text": "have you had any weight loss or low mood?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0020",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 172.97,
      "end_seconds": 178.68,
      "duration_seconds": 5.71,
      "text": "um you know none as far as I know"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0021",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 179.66,
      "end_seconds": 183.87,
      "duration_seconds": 4.21,
      "text": "Have you had any alcohol problems or coughing up blood?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0022",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 185.48,
      "end_seconds": 188.88,
      "duration_seconds": 3.4,
      "text": "right none as far as I know"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0023",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 190.36,
      "end_seconds": 193.26,
      "duration_seconds": 2.9,
      "text": "how are your bowels, any trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0024",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 194.29,
      "end_seconds": 198.6,
      "duration_seconds": 4.31,
      "text": "hmm uh no that side's been fine"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0025",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 200.08,
      "end_seconds": 203.43,
      "duration_seconds": 3.35,
      "text": "has your heart given you any trouble?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0026",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 205.39,
      "end_seconds": 210.34,
      "duration_seconds": 4.95,
      "text": "My heart's been fine as far as I know."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0027",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 212.04,
      "end_seconds": 214.88,
      "duration_seconds": 2.84,
      "text": "is there anything medical in your background?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0028",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 216.91,
      "end_seconds": 225.03,
      "duration_seconds": 8.12,
      "text": "I've had COPD, yes. I just want to get back to normal, really."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0029",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 234.13,
      "end_seconds": 239.04,
      "duration_seconds": 4.91,
      "text": "anyone in the family with similar problems or other conditions?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0030",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 240.41,
      "end_seconds": 242.72,
      "duration_seconds": 2.31,
      "text": "My father was diabetic."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0031",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 243.22,
      "end_seconds": 247.91,
      "duration_seconds": 4.69,
      "text": "let's talk a a little about your daily life and habits"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0032",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 249.67,
      "end_seconds": 265.26,
      "duration_seconds": 15.59,
      "text": "I don't drink at all. I've never smoked. I'm a self-employed electrician. I live with my family, my husband and two kids. I skip breakfast most days."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0033",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 266.39,
      "end_seconds": 269.45,
      "duration_seconds": 3.06,
      "text": "okay, are you on any regular medication?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0034",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 269.95,
      "end_seconds": 271.07,
      "duration_seconds": 1.12,
      "text": "nothing no"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0035",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 272.17,
      "end_seconds": 277.18,
      "duration_seconds": 5.01,
      "text": "Are there any allergies on your record that I should check?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0036",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 281.28,
      "end_seconds": 286.74,
      "duration_seconds": 5.46,
      "text": "well, you know, no, none that that I know of"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0037",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 302.68,
      "end_seconds": 322.7,
      "duration_seconds": 20.02,
      "text": "okay thinking it through I'd lean towards nicotine dependence. I want to be honest that this is an impression not a final answer. Early chronic bronchitis is also on my list. I think breathing tests makes sense here for smoker's cough"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0038",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 324.7,
      "end_seconds": 326.37,
      "duration_seconds": 1.67,
      "text": "will it hurt?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0039",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 330.8,
      "end_seconds": 338.82,
      "duration_seconds": 8.02,
      "text": "I'm gonna put you on nicotine patches, 14 milligrams, once a day, for six weeks that's for smoking cessation"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0040",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 340.01,
      "end_seconds": 345.71,
      "duration_seconds": 5.7,
      "text": "I mean should I keep taking it if I feel better?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0041",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 346.25,
      "end_seconds": 355.99,
      "duration_seconds": 9.74,
      "text": "Pick a quit date this month, and tell your family so they can back you up. Let's plan a check in two weeks."
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0042",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 360.55,
      "end_seconds": 361.25,
      "duration_seconds": 0.7,
      "text": "okay"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0043",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 362.91,
      "end_seconds": 370.13,
      "duration_seconds": 7.22,
      "text": "Right, can you run through the plan with me quickly, just to to be certain?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0044",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 371.71,
      "end_seconds": 378.25,
      "duration_seconds": 6.54,
      "text": "so, you know, I come back in two weeks. Is that right?"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0045",
      "speaker_id": "person_2",
      "role": "DOCTOR",
      "start_seconds": 380.1,
      "end_seconds": 384.7,
      "duration_seconds": 4.6,
      "text": "yes, exactly right. Good. Let us know how you get on"
    },
    {
      "segment_id": "SEG0046",
      "speaker_id": "person_1",
      "role": "PATIENT",
      "start_seconds": 386.35,
      "end_seconds": 389.72,
      "duration_seconds": 3.37,
      "text": "yeah, thank you for your time"
    }
